ation" style="vertical-align:top;" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="font-size:0px;word-break:break-word;"><div style="height:30px;line-height:30px;">â€Š</div></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="font-size:0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;word-break:break-word;"><div style="font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1;text-align:left;color:#000000;"><p class="text-build-content" data-testid="fNfM898MH94xi2PX91-s7" style="margin: 10px 0; margin-top: 10px;"><span style="color:#808080;font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;">Hi Malika</span></p><p class="text-build-content" data-testid="fNfM898MH94xi2PX91-s7" style="margin: 10px 0;"><span style="color:#808080;font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;">Welcome to our latest newsletter.</span></p><p class="text-build-content" data-testid="fNfM898MH94xi2PX91-s7" style="margin: 10px 0;"><span style="color:#808080;font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;">In this edition, you'll find business tips and advice, and the latest from our blog.</span></p><p class="text-build-content" data-testid="fNfM898MH94xi2PX91-s7" style="margin: 10px 0;"><span style="color:#808080;font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;">There is also the chance to win a Â£200 Amazon voucher in our Company Quiz, plus details of our exclusive offer of a 30 day free trial with monday.com.</span></p><p class="text-build-content" data-testid="fNfM898MH94xi2PX91-s7" style="margin: 10px 0; margin-bottom: 10px;"><span style="color:#808080;font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;">We've been delighted by the response to our new serviced office and meeting room facilities at 71-75 Shelton Street. Don't worry if you haven't registered your interest yet, there's still some availability. See the bottom of the newsletter for more information.</span></p></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></