adding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="" style="vertical-align:top;width:590px;" ><![endif]--><div class="mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix" style="font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="vertical-align:top;" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="font-size:0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;word-break:break-word;"><div style="font-family:Ubuntu, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1;text-align:left;color:#000000;"><h1 class="text-build-content" data-testid="x6fiUu-9Y" style="margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px;"><b>BUSINESS TIPS AND ADVICE</b></span></h1></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]--></td></tr></tbody></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="" role="presentation" style="width:600px;" width="600" bgcolor="#ffffff" ><tr><td style="line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;"><![endif]--><div style="background:#ffffff;background-color:#ffffff;margin:0px auto;max-width:600px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="background:#ffffff;background-color:#ffffff;width:100%;"><tbody><tr><td style="direction:ltr;font-size:0px;padding:0px 5px 0px 5px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:5px;padding-right:5px;padding-top:0px;text-align:center;"><!--[if mso | IE]><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="" style="vertical-align:top;width:590px;" ><![endif]--><div class="mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix" style="font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="vertical-align:top;" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td align="center" style="font-size:0px;padding:10px 0px 10px 0px;padding-right:0px;padding-left:0px;word-break:break-word;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0px;"><tbody><tr><td style="width:590px;"><a href="https://037lq.mjt.lu/lnk/AUYAACAVGP8AAAAFOugAAA10fpoAAAAAd9cAAT3eABzJbgBkwpp8F_hGwPM3QbyheTSOrwzNmAAbd4o/2/LXFpKXSyysEOzpu1lth4mA/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuMXN0Zm9ybWF0aW9ucy5jby51ay9ibG9nL2RvZ3MtaW4tdGhlLXdvcmtwbGFjZS8" target="_blank"><img alt="" src="https://037lq.mjt.lu/tplimg/037lq/b/m15ks/054u9.png" style="border:none;display:block;outline:none;text-decoration:none;height:auto;width:100%;font-size:13px;" width="590" height="auto"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="font-size:0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;word-break:break-word;"><div style="font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:21px;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1;text-align:left;color:#000000;"><p class="text-build-content" style="line-height: 22px; margin: 10px 0; margin-top: 10px;" data-testid="BgCoiezbrvScFIDXwxPd6"><a class="link-build-content" style="color:inherit;; text-decoration: none;" target="_blank" href="https://037lq.mjt.lu/lnk/AUYAACAVGP8AAAAFOugAAA10fpoAAAAAd9cAAT3eABzJbgBkwpp8F_hGwPM3QbyheTSOrwzNmAAbd4o/3/9uU4cQzSZ1shLpODVni9jw/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuMXN0Zm9ybWF0aW9ucy5jby51ay9ibG9nL2RvZ3MtaW4tdGhlLXdvcmtwbGFjZS8"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:21px;">Dogs in the workplace - 7 things to consider</span></a></p><p class="text-build-content" style="line-height: 22px; margin: 10px 0; margin-bottom: 10px;" data-testid="BgCoiezbrvScFIDXwxPd6"><span style="color:#767676;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;">Dogs in the workplace are shown to boost staff morale, increasing productivity, and improve employee retention and recruitment. It can be a game-changer for businesses of all sizes across a variety of industries, and it's a great way to encourage home-based workers to return to the office. </span><a class="link-build-content" style="color:inherit;; text-decoration: none;" target="_blank" href="https://037lq.mjt.lu/lnk/AUYAACAVGP8AAAAFOugAAA10fpoAAAAAd9cAAT3eABzJbgBkwpp8F_hGwPM3QbyheTSOrwzNmAAbd4o/4/JswaPFsG3JEP4l9WS_-PxA/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuMXN0Zm9ybWF0aW9ucy5jby51ay9ibG9nL2RvZ3MtaW4tdGhlLXdvcmtwbGFjZS8"><span style="color:#31a5cb;font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;"><u>Read More</u></span></a></p></div></td></tr><tr><td style="font-size:0px;word-break:break-word;"><div style="height:10px;line-height:10px;">â€Š</div></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="font-size:0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;word-break:break-word;"><div style="font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:21px;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1;text-align:left;color:#000000;"><p class="text-build-content" style="line-height: 22px; margin: 10px 0; margin-top: 10px;" data-testid="mXSKgF0lBLJ62mf7OADnE"><a class="link-build-content" style="color:inherit;; text-decoration: none;" target="_blank" href="https://037lq.mjt.lu/lnk/AUYAACAVGP8AAAAFOugAAA10fpoAAAAAd9cAAT3eABzJbgBkwpp8F_hGwPM3QbyheTSOrwzNmAAbd4o/5/2TZr8cSGW1TB46-DPLkCuQ/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuMXN0Zm9ybWF0aW9ucy5jby51ay9ibG9nL3NoYXJlLWJ1eWJhY2tzLw"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:21px;">Share buybacks and why companies purchase their own shares</span></a></p><p class="text-build-content" style="line-height: 22px; margin: 10px 0; margin-bottom: 10px;" data-testid="mXSKgF0lBLJ62mf7OADnE"><span style="color:#767676;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;">Share buybacks occur in all types of private and public companies limited by shares. Also known as a 'purchase of own shares', a buyback is a popular and legitimate way for a company to return surplus cash to members, increase the value of shares, and provide an exit route for shareholders.&nbsp;</span><a class="link-build-content" style="color:inherit;; text-decoration: none;" target="_blank" href="https://037lq.mjt.lu/lnk/AUYAACAVGP8AAAAFOugAAA10fpoAAAAAd9cAAT3eABzJbgBkwpp8F_hGwPM3QbyheTSOrwzNmAAbd4o/6/vRr1ZiAhXFTzcXgrCfghhg/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuMXN0Zm9ybWF0aW9ucy5jby51ay9ibG9nL3NoYXJlLWJ1eWJhY2tzLw"><span style="color:#31a5cb;font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;"><u>Read More</u></span></a></p></div></td></tr><tr><td style="font-size:0px;word-break:break-word;"><div style="height:10px;line-height:10px;">â€Š</div></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="font-size:0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;word-break:break-word;"><div style="font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:21px;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1;text-align:left;color:#000000;"><p class="text-build-content" style="line-height: 22px; margin: 10px 0; margin-top: 10px;" data-testid="FsyUoUV8EXRzxMci_WKl6"><a class="link-build-content" style="color:inherit;; text-decoration: none;" target="_blank" href="https://037lq.mjt.lu/lnk/AUYAACAVGP8AAAAFOugAAA10fpoAAAAAd9cAAT3eABzJbgBkwpp8F_hGwPM3QbyheTSOrwzNmAAbd4o/7/d2qXQvDaz6zSFyNPXHS6ZQ/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuMXN0Zm9ybWF0aW9ucy5jby51ay9ibG9nL2d1aWRlLXRvLXBpdm90aW5nLWJ1c2luZXNzLw"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:21px;">Guide to pivoting a business</span></a></p><p class="text-build-content" style="line-height: 22px; margin: 10px 0; margin-bottom: 10px;" data-testid="FsyUoUV8EXRzxMci_WKl6"><span style="color:#767676;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;">Pivoting a business involves strategically changing course in some way, with the aim being to improve viability or increase profits. If pivoting is something that you are contemplating, it's important to first understand what it actually entails. &nbsp;</span><a class="link-build-content" style="color:inherit;; text-decoration: none;" target="_blank" href="https://037lq.mjt.lu/lnk/AUYAACAVGP8AAAAFOugAAA10fpoAAAAAd9cAAT3eABzJbgBkwpp8F_hGwPM3QbyheTSOrwzNmAAbd4o/8/l_RmV_2w7KjLDY-z7UlK-g/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuMXN0Zm9ybWF0aW9ucy5jby51ay9ibG9nL2d1aWRlLXRvLXBpdm90aW5nLWJ1c2luZXNzLw"><span style="color:#31a5cb;font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;"><u>Read More</u></span></a></p></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]--></td></tr></tbody></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="" role="presentation" style="width:600px;" width="600" ><tr><td style="line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;"><![endif]--><div style="margin:0px auto;max-width:600px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="width:100%;"><tbody><tr><td style="direction:ltr;font-size:0px;padding:5px 0px 5px 0px;padding-bottom:5px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:5px;text-align:center;"><!--[if mso | IE]><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="" style="vertical-align:top;width:600px;" ><![endif]--><div class="mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix" style="font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="vertical-align:top;" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="font-size:0px;word-break:break-word;"><div style="height:10px;line-height:10px;">â€Š</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]--></td></tr></tbody></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="" role="presentation" style="width:600px;" width="600" bgcolor="#ffffff" ><tr><td style="line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;"><![endif]--><div style="background:#ffffff;backgr